      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『Parcae』能去“理解”。它能够分析输入的数据，\n推导出正确的答案。它能够忠实、正确地理解我的意图并行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "495054ee5d0729576cf3bfbc0d55303b25c9a415fa9226d776deb3422cc02aa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
