      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她基本上都是紧踩门禁时间的。是属于不良少女吗？\r\n感觉她总是一副很烦躁的样子……是在想些什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c4581e0217f3e7ce9c0bf628e78e14180284eb60588d6b2ba4827b7642b0efa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
